                                "sense_id": "4859593d-2b91-3dc9-a860-05dd4c0df22d",
                                "text": "The only overlap is that fitters of the electric side are responsible for repairing electrical faults in the diesel multiple-units, but even this has led to trouble, as diesel fitters called out to repair a multiple-unit, having diagnosed the fault as electrical, have been unequipped to deal with it."
